[17592186139341 #edb/ref 1061 193359 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139341 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6a8787b7-2b51-553a-a6d3-45dbce73fd6d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139341 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186138420 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139342 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186139343 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139342 #edb/ref 1061 193363 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139342 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b9ad9381-9b48-5b5b-b8f0-6beb54354def" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139342 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186138421 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139343 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186139344 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139343 #edb/ref 1061 193367 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139343 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e3178dc6-d3e2-5d72-8f0b-b70219a656cd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139343 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186138422 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139344 #edb/ref 1061 193370 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139344 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "89a98a58-be61-5132-9c41-09105a97def2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139344 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186138423 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139725 #edb/ref 1064 "The **difference of squares formula** states the product of the sum and the difference of two monomials is equal to the difference of their squares:\n\n$$\n(a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2\n$$\n\nWe can check that this result is correct by expanding the binomial in the usual way, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t({\\color{blue}a} + {\\color{red}b})(a - b) &= \\[5pt]\n\t\t{\\color{blue}a}(a - b) + {\\color{red}b}(a - b) &= \\[5pt]\n\t\ta^2 - ab + ab - b^2 &= \\[5pt]\n\t\ta^2 - b^2 \\,& {\\color{green}{\\checkmark}}\n\t}\n$$\n\nNotice that the middle two terms $- ab$ and $ab$ cancel each other out, leaving only $a^2 - b^2.$ \n\nIf the order of multiplication is switched, the formula still remains the same:\n\n$$\n(a - b)(a + b) = a^2 - b^2\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139725 #edb/ref 1065 8883 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139725 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "5aaa853f-8b04-5d91-8c05-f30646908746" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186139725 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186234126 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186492718 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186234126 #edb/ref 1069 "q-5132" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186234126 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186234126 #edb/ref 1071 "$(9{u}^{3}-4{v}^{2})(9{u}^{3}+4{v}^{2})=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186234126 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "a97a25c8-3d64-58a0-8a46-bc117211d97c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186234126 #edb/ref 1074 "We will use the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n(a+b)(a-b)={a}^{2}-{b}^{2}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a=9{u}^{3}$ and $b=4{v}^{2},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(9{u}^{3}-4{v}^{2})(9{u}^{3}+4{v}^{2}) & = \\\\ {(9{u}^{3})}^{2}-{(4{v}^{2})}^{2} & = \\\\ 81{u}^{6}-16{v}^{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492218 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186492952 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492218 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186492985 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492218 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186492990 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492218 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492218 #edb/ref 1045 "The Difference of Squares Formula" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492218 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186492985 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492218 #edb/ref 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046648 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492218 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049943 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492218 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "df48017b-4d7c-5511-b957-c8a8c5cf6c3a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492248 #edb/ref 1080 "49{w}^{2}-20w+16" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492248 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492248 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "11a9a132-bbd3-56be-adc6-9533d084b6e7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492326 #edb/ref 1080 "49{w}^{2}-16" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1759