045417] [17592186492848 #edb/ref 1074 "We will use the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n(a+b)(a-b)={a}^{2}-{b}^{2}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a=7w$ and $b=4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(7w-4)(7w+4) & = \\\\ (7w)^{2}-{4}^{2} & = \\\\ 49{w}^{2}-16.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492909 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186492768 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492909 #edb/ref 1069 "q-78928" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492909 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492909 #edb/ref 1071 "$({k}^{m}+\\sqrt{5})({k}^{m}-\\sqrt{5})=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492909 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c1188285-b76b-5dfe-bc37-680ab9486187" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492909 #edb/ref 1074 "We will use the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n(a+b)(a-b)={a}^{2}-{b}^{2}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a={k}^{m}$ and $b=\\sqrt{5},$ we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({k}^{m}+\\sqrt{5})({k}^{m}-\\sqrt{5}) & = \\\\ ({k}^{m})^{2}-(\\sqrt{5})^{2} & = \\\\ {k}^{2m}-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492952 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186492990 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492952 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "5fea5894-0ceb-5f99-955a-9c7a291f853c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492952 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186492848 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492985 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186492952 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492985 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "aceced29-dbef-543a-9e7f-9315fba7db9c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492985 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186234126 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492990 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "bac4923d-4220-5254-af97-b724a6683d30" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492990 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186492909 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
